[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3364389150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111177#issuecomment-3364389150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111177","id":3364389150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IiIEe","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T06:08:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T07:21:33Z","body":"Limited amount of time to look at this today (I'll be back after the weekend) but a quick profile shows that in 2D it does interpolation for all items, whether or not they are moving.\n\nThis is normally not a problem (providing reasonable amount of items on screen), but it can be compounded in some situations in 4.x, as it doesn't have 2D hierarchical culling (it processes items that are off screen as well as on screen) and doesn't have `MultiRect`, so it does a lot more per item processing than 3.x.\n\nIt's possible I can optimize this to reduce the processing on non-moving items as this seems more of an issue in 4.x.\n\n_Although no promises at this stage : 2D rendering combines the camera in the 2D xforms. I can't remember the details as it is a few years since I wrote this, and there was probably a reason why it doesn't do this already._\n\nIn 3D in contrast, there is no cost for FTI with non-moving items, but 3D processing for rendering is totally different.. there are trade-offs either way.\n\nUPDATE:\nIt looks like I may have simply forgotten to check one of the flags, which should speed up performance in this case for 4.x particularly. I'll double check this is correct after the weekend and do a 4.x version. 👍 \n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3364389150/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3367155028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111177#issuecomment-3367155028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111177","id":3367155028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IsrVU","user":{"login":"MatthiasBae","id":52577744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTc3NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52577744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthiasBae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/events{/privacy}","receive